event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":84,"item_id":"rs_024f2a63f4a73739016aca0ed3b7908195927535ca2da1c671","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Planning project migration**\n\nI need to focus on adding the ordering position migration with a default creation of max per project. This involves creating an atomic update that uses a single statement subquery for the maximum destination. I'll also be working on the API to PATCH the destination_project_id and return the moved data. It looks like I need to adjust the test mock for /api/projects accordingly. Let's see how that all works together!"}

